parent_location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Basement Meeting Room 005 (Sub-Level Cloisters, Basilica Library, SUCC);
Setting: Nondescript, slightly cramped basement meeting room tucked behind old maintenance stacks;
Factions: Student Club Coalitions, Anime Club, Alternative Student Gatherings;
Conflicts: Low administrative funding for niche student clubs, scheduling fights with custodial storage needs;
Society: Welcoming nerd subculture, quirky collegiate camaraderie, unpretentious hangout spot]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Mildly musty basement air, scent of cardboard pizza boxes, sweet snacks, computer projector fan warmth;
Architecture: Concrete walls painted beige, folding laminate tables, mismatched office chairs, drop-ceiling acoustic tiles;
Security & Wards: Basic keyed brass door lock, simple overhead emergency exit signage;
Demographics: Anime Club members, niche hobbyists, student gaming enthusiasts;
Rules & Restrictions: Throw away trash in exterior dumpster, return chairs to perimeter when adjourned]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Originally constructed as overflow archival microfilm storage, repurposed into a student activity room;
Secrets: Behind the portable white projector screen is a decommissioned metal hatch opening into the old campus steam tunnels]

