world_locations.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Anime Club (Resident Assembly, Basement Meeting Room 005, SUCC);
Setting: Lively student hobby organization and weekly screening lounge celebrating Japanese animation and pop culture;
Factions: SUCC Anime & Manga Club Officers, Cosplay Circle, General Members;
Conflicts: Deciding screening schedules between shonen tournaments and vintage mecha classics;
Society: Enthusiastic fan culture, inclusive collegiate geekdom, lively debates over favorite character arcs]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Aroma of microwaved cup noodles, sweet Japanese milk tea, laughter, projector fan drone, anime theme songs;
Architecture: Portable projector setup, taped anime posters on walls, folding chairs gathered in rows, manga swap table;
Security & Wards: Standard club door monitor, informal friendly greeting;
Demographics: Passionate undergraduates, demihuman anime fans, cosplay crafters, human nerds;
Rules & Restrictions: No spoilers for current airing seasonal series, respect everyone's favorite series]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Founded in the early 2000s, growing into one of the largest and most enthusiastic non-Greek student social clubs;
Secrets: The club's shared external hard drive contains rare fan-subbed occult anime series banned from official streaming]

parent_location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Bloodmoon Longhouse (Sovereign Hearth, Bloodmoon Pack Territory, Blackwood Forest);
Setting: Millennium-old Norse timber longhouse built beneath the sprawling boughs of Wulfnic's sacred yew;
Factions: Wulfnic Bloodmoon, Firstborn Elders, Bloodmoon Pack Council;
Conflicts: Carrying the crushing weight of a thousand years of pack history vs adapting to the survival of the bloodline;
Society: Traditional Viking hall culture, central hearth gathering, oral storytelling, absolute reverence for the Patriarch]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Roaring central peat and pine hearth fires, scent of cured meats, mead, tallow candles, seasoned timber, and ancient wolf pelt;
Architecture: Massive curved timber beams crafted from Wulfnic's original 11th-century drakkar, turf-insulated roof, central fire trench;
Security & Wards: Complete acoustic vacuum and anti-electronic dead zone, ancient Icelandic blood runes carved into structural pillars;
Demographics: Wulfnic, ancient kin, senior pack warriors, summoned Douglas family leaders;
Rules & Restrictions: Weapons drawn only in defense of the hall, no disrespect shown to the central fire, speak truth before the Alpha]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Erected in 1022 AD using the salvaged oak timbers of Wulfnic's ship that crossed the northern seas;
Secrets: Deep cold-cellars beneath the hearth store ancient runestones and ancestral relics predating the discovery of the continent]

