world_locations.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Bloodmoon Longhouse Baths (Thermal Springhouse, Bloodmoon Compound, Blackwood Forest);
Setting: Ancient log bathhouse built directly over a natural steaming thermal sulfur spring;
Factions: Bloodmoon Household, Traditional Healers, Bath Attendants;
Conflicts: Maintaining ancient restorative procedures unchanged vs healing traumatic modern battlefield wounds;
Society: Communal purification ritual, shared biological restoration, timeless ancestral household routine]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Dense rising plumes of white steam, pungent natural mineral sulfur, hot stone scent, damp cedar, and dripping condensation;
Architecture: Single massive interlocking log construction, stone basin carved directly from native bedrock, open smoke slits in roof;
Security & Wards: Natural bedrock seclusion, thermal mist offering complete visual obscurity from the forest;
Demographics: Bloodmoon pack members, wounded warriors recovering vitality, elders soothing ancient joints;
Rules & Restrictions: Respect traditional bath preparation, absolute silence or quiet reflection during purification immersion]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Used continuously for ten centuries without interruption or architectural modification;
Secrets: The hot geothermal spring water originates from deep subterranean aquifers charged with primal earth magic]

parent_location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Fraternity & Sorority Row / Greek Row (Collegiate Boulevard, SUCC Campus);
Setting: Broad avenue lined with massive Greek Revival chapter houses, collegiate party capital;
Factions: Interfraternity Council (IFC), Panhellenic Council, Ten Chartered Greek Houses;
Conflicts: Intense inter-house territorial rivalries vs campus administration discipline, wild rush-week chaos;
Society: Greek collegiate hierarchy, strict chapter traditions, house loyalty, round-the-clock weekend revelry]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Scent of fresh-cut lawns, keg beer, barbecue smoke, perfume, amplified bass reverberations, and roaring collegiate chants;
Architecture: Sprawling two- and three-story neoclassical chapter mansions with white columns, expansive party front lawns;
Security & Wards: House security captains, discreet campus peacekeeper observation, emergency distress alarms;
Demographics: Undergraduate Greek brothers and sisters, collegiate partygoers, athletes, campus socialites;
Rules & Restrictions: House rules strictly enforced by chapter presidents, no unauthorized intrusions into private dorm wings]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Established alongside the university to organize diverse supernatural student groups into self-governing houses;
Secrets: Underground basement passages connect several rival houses, enabling clandestine midnight prank raids and secret truces]

