Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Alpha Sigma Sigma / ASS (Fourth Mansion Outer Side, Greek Row, SUCC);
Setting: Neoclassical chapter house situated between Phi Omicron Chi and Beta Epsilon Epsilon, facing DOE;
Factions: Alpha Sigma Sigma Brotherhood, Vampire & Undead Association Allies, Student Athletes;
Conflicts: Chapter reputation for wild hedonism vs maintaining academic standing, party cleanup disputes;
Society: Fierce fraternal solidarity, flamboyant self-expression, lavish house parties, welcoming to outcasts]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Heavy party energy, scent of spilled fruit punch, cologne, fresh pizza, glowing colored party lights, thumping speakers;
Architecture: Wide Greek Revival facade with gilded Greek letters, spacious hardwood ballroom floor, rear deck and hot tub;
Security & Wards: Heavy front door bouncers during socials, private chapter room accessible only by secret handshake;
Demographics: Diverse supernatural brothers, athletic vampires, charismatic shifters, party regulars;
Rules & Restrictions: Respect house brothers, clean up after socials, what happens in chapter meetings stays in chapter meetings]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Renowned for legendary campus socials and hosting students who reject stuffy aristocratic snobbery;
Secrets: The locked chapter archives in the attic hold an unbroken sixty-year logbook of collegiate campus pranks]

