[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Beta Epsilon Epsilon / BEE (Outer Side Promenade, Greek Row, SUCC);
Setting: Vibrant, socially active sorority house known for sisterhood unity and philanthropic galas;
Factions: Beta Epsilon Epsilon Sisterhood, Panhellenic Council, Philanthropy Organizers;
Conflicts: Balancing intense social calendars with academic demands, elaborate rush-week coordination;
Society: Warm inclusive sisterhood, mutual emotional support, vibrant social hosting, community charity]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Fragrance of sweet floral perfumes, freshly baked cookies, lavender diffusers, bright sunshine, joyful laughter;
Architecture: Elegant pale-yellow manor with wrap-around porch, floral hanging baskets, spacious communal sun parlor;
Security & Wards: Sister-only keycard locks, perimeter wards ensuring privacy in residential wings;
Demographics: Undergraduate sorority sisters, fae, demihumans, charismatic student leaders;
Rules & Restrictions: Quiet hours enforced during midterms, male guests restricted from upper bedroom floors after midnight]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Established as one of the founding sororities on campus, famous for organizing the annual Spring Charity Gala;
Secrets: The private sunroom houses a living enchanted floral garden that blooms in response to collective sister harmony]

