Architecture: Crystalline caverns, sunken prehistoric marshes, monolithic obsidian ruins and primordial draconic nesting grounds;
Security & Wards: Ancient geological rift fault in Blackwood Forest acting as a semi-permeable natural gate, dangerous spatial shear at the perimeter;
Demographics: Draconids, wild chimeric predators, deep-rift spirits, rare high-tier explorers;
Rules & Restrictions: No mortal communication signals, GPS non-functional, reality shifts can trap unprepared travelers during dimensional drift]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
